Loader tray layer detection failed (HT9050 loader drawer).
(1) The layer probe found no top tray: the loader tray sensor (SnLoaderTrayHasTray) was on at every layer up to 20, or off at every layer down to 1.
(2) Check the number of trays in the loader drawer (20 at most) and the loader tray sensor.
(3) Press <RETRY> to detect the layers again.
